# Prisma's vendored agent-skill docs. Installed by tooling, mirrored into
# .claude/ and .windsurf/ as symlinks, and re-fetchable at any time — 87 files
# of reference material (including MongoDB and SQL Server guides) that no
# import reaches. Only the skills/ subdirectory is ignored, so real project
# config in .claude/ stays tracked.
.agents/
.claude/skills/
.windsurf/skills/
skills-lock.json
